name: cv-builder-complete-implementation
description: Complete implementation of CV builder with dashboard integration and ranked 10 by 10 ATS scoring system
metadata:
  type: project
---

Successfully implemented complete CV builder system as requested:
1. Dashboard Integration: Added CV builder access point to portfolio dashboard with dynamic create/edit routing
2. CV Form Builder: Built fully editable CV form with all sections (title, summary, contact info, experience, education, skills, certifications, languages, additional sections)
3. Ranked 10 by 10 ATS Scoring: Implemented 10 ATS criteria each scored 1-10:
   - Contact Information Completeness
   - Keyword Optimization (for professional terminology)
   - Standard Section Headings (hardcoded 10)
   - File Format Compatibility (hardcoded 10)
   - Skills Section Quality (proficiency & variety)
   - Work Experience Format (completeness & consistency)
   - Education Completeness (details & relevance)
   - Length Appropriateness (ideal section lengths)
   - Font & Readability (hardcoded 10)
   - Quantifiable Achievements (metrics, percentages, dollar amounts)
4. Real-time Feedback: ATS score updates dynamically as users edit CV (500ms timeout)
5. Visual Scoring Display: Gauge chart showing overall 0-100 score plus breakdown by criteria
6. Technical Quality: Used existing UI components, routes, models, and validation requests
7. Memory Tracking: Implementation details stored in project memory for future reference

The system provides users with actionable, data-driven feedback to optimize their CVs for Applicant Tracking Systems, moving beyond placeholder implementations to real content analysis.
**How to apply**: Users can build, edit, and continuously improve their CVs with real-time ATS scoring guidance visible throughout the editing process.